  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "超大型積體電路製程(二)",
    "sub_ename": "VLSI TECHNOLOGY(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為介紹超大型積體電路技術之製程與理論基礎。主要著重在VLSI後段製程， 如:薄膜沉積（CVD, PVD）， 蝕刻(濕蝕刻，電漿蝕刻) ， 金屬接觸， 積體電路多層金屬連線製程與可靠度....等。",
    "describe_eh": "Silicon integrated circuit technology makes use of many diverse fields of science and engineering.  This course attempts to describe not only the manufacturing practice associated with the technologies used in silicon chip fabrication, but also the underlying scientific basis for those technologies.  The VLSI technology (2) mainly deals with the back-end processes for VLSI, including thin film deposition (CVD and PVD), etching (wet etching and plasma etching), contacts, interconnects, and vias...etc.",
    "pre_subname": "ELEN4010超大型積體電路製程(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ELEN4010",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ELEN4010 VLSI TECHNOLOGY(1)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
